{"server":"jp","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_07_end","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_07","title":"最終防衛線","storyCode":"OD-7","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"5d3d0153def1940e5c7bf2410d3f7cd96aa93a7e916ec5da9f8fc78096ca685d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"変異生物の数ははかり知れず、領主の屋敷を防衛するオペレーターたちは苦戦を強いられていた。Tachankaは他の者が避難所へ退避するための殿を務めた上で、一人全てに立ち向かおうと決意する。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nobleD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ピカール","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ええい、どけ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ピカール","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"次から次へと。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"あいつら一体どれだけ化け物を作ってたんだ！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"リスカム！　後ろじゃ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"オリジニュータント","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"グアァ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"危ない！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"フランカ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何してるの！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ピカールさん、手を貸してください！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ピカール","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"わ、わかった！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早く……逃げなさい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黙ってて！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足がちょっとね……構わなくていいからさっさと逃げて。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"バカなこと言わないで！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"わたしが背負うから、ほら乗って。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ピカール","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奴らがまた来るぞ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"今のうちに！　早く逃げろ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"オクフェン","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"こちらへ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"オクフェンさん！　どうして出てきたんですか！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"オクフェン","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"ただ下で待ってるなんてできません！　私もロドスのオペレーターなんですから！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……ありがとうございます！　助かりました！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"爆発物を起爆するぞい……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"3、2、1……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"どうだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"ほんの少し散らしただけじゃ。すぐにまた集まってくるじゃろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"奴ら……少しは数が減った？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"「ウェルカムマット」を設置した。あと、私も弾切れ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"アレクサンドル、次はどうするの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"避難所へ行け。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"避難所へ急げ！　ロドスのオペレーターたちを連れて避難所へ行くんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"なら、あなたは？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"俺はお前たちをカバーする。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"カバー？　なら誰がアレクサンドルをカバーするの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"俺にそんなもの必要ない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"熱くならないで、アレクサンドル！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"俺は冷静だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"俺はもう、隠れるのにも逃げるのにもうんざりなんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"撤退では戦争に勝利をもたらすことはできない。歴史がそれを数え切れないほど証明している。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"でもこれは戦争じゃないのよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"俺に言わせれば、これこそが戦争だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"あいつらが武器を掲げ、俺の仲間に危害を加えようとし、俺がそれを防ぐ。それを戦争以外の何だというのだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"俺はあまりに多くの戦争を経験してきた。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"俺がここでクソッタレなモンスターを殺せば殺すほど、町民たちの生存率が上がる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"だから俺がここを守る。弾が尽き果てても、永遠に守り抜く。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"戦争の最中にいて、撤退なんて選択肢はない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"「英雄になろうとするな、必ず失敗する」。あなたの言葉よ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"ティナ、俺は英雄になるつもりなんてない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"正しいことをしているだけだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"何が何でも……すべて今日で終わらせるんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"アレクサンドル！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"儂が残ろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"ご老人、なぜあなたまでも……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"こうなることはわかっておった。おぬしらが力を貸してくれると言うた時から、おおよその展開は予想できておった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"儂が残って、この戦士と共に守ろうぞ。もし状況があまりにひどくなれば、あやつを引きずってでも撤退するわい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"ご老人……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"アレクサンドル、これを。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"これは？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"私が試作した源石爆発物。最後の二つよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"……助かる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"生きて帰ってきて！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"……保証はできない。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"人が悪いな、あんたも撤退するつもりなんてないくせに。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"ハハハッ……老いぼれの心を読むでない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"おぬしの武器を活かすには、前線で押し寄せるモンスター抑えておく者が必要になるからのう。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"そいつは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"先代の領主の刀だそうじゃ。拝借してきたんじゃよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"いい刀じゃのう。悪くない趣味をしておる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"美しい刃文、手作業ではめこまれたターコイズの柄。現代の工業製品に全く劣らぬ逸品じゃ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"最前線で刀を振るうより、後方で弓を構えておった方が安全なのは目に見えとるがのう……儂にも格好つけさせてもらうぞい。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"老いたものじゃな。動きがだいぶ鈍っておる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"だが刀もあんたも動きも、抜群にキレてるぜ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"そういえばまだおぬしの名を知らぬな、戦士よ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"アレクサンドル・セナフィエフ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"アレクサンドルと呼んでくれ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"わかった。ふむ、儂もおぬしに名を告げるべきなんじゃろうな……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レンジャー","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"じゃが鮮血が谷を染めたあの日、儂の名は過去のすべてと共に、砂漠の下に埋もれてしまったんじゃ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"構わない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"あんたは残って戦うと決めてくれた。それで十分だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"「レンジャー」、準備はいいか。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"「皆は、俺が死んだと言う。だがそれは違う。俺は生まれ変わったんだ」"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"あのモンスターがどれだけいようと……関係ない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"さあ、かかってこい。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","aliases":["Frost"]},{"speakerId":"char_459_tachak","aliases":["Tachanka"]},{"speakerId":"char_503_rang","aliases":["レンジャー"]}]}
